  "result": "I fixed it, and the demo now removes the Widget line.\n\n**Root cause:** `Cart.remove` in `shop/models.py:31` checked each line's item name against the argument instead of its SKU (`l.item.name != sku`). `'sku-1'` never equals `'Widget'`, so nothing was ever removed. I changed the check to `l.item.sku != sku`.\n\n**Checks:**\n- `python3 -m shop.demo` now prints `1`: only the Gadget line is left. Before the fix it would have printed 2.\n- All 6 tests pass. pytest isn't installed here, so I ran them with `python3 -m unittest`.\n\nNo test covers `Cart.remove`, so the suite would not have caught this bug and won't catch it coming back. I didn't add one.",
